# SubscriptionPlanCard on DemoPage

## Source of truth
- Samples come from `PurchaseFlowSubscriptionOrderPopup` (upgrade current/new, subscribe) and the default gold subscribe-login card.
- Show Code is a full pasteable `<SubscriptionPlanCard>` with feature `t()` keys — never `demo.` for title / price / footer.
- Images use `useCheckoutDemoAssets()` (`assets.profileSlideinBg`, `assets.planLogo`, `assets.featuredMediaBg`) — not ibb URLs.
- Looks are `theme` names: `defaultGold`, `upgradeCurrent`, `upgradeNew`, `subscribe`. Do not paste long `left-section-gradient` / accent strings in Show Code.

## Do not demo
- Invented tiers or accent colors that no checkout popup renders.
- Duplicate the same card under Checkout Reusable — this section owns `SubscriptionPlanCard`.
